  "releaseNotes": "1.3.2 - packaging only. Release assemblies no longer embed the build machine's symbol path, so the published package does not disclose the builder's local file system. No functional change from 1.3.1, whose notes follow. 1.3.1 - registers the application directory as an additional Razor file provider so the suite's shipped views and partials resolve on a fresh NuGet install. Also, following a pre-release audit: Adds ICommunityOriginResolver, which refuses to build a password-reset or verification link from an unvalidated Host header: set Community:Auth:BaseUrl to your public site URL, or AllowedHosts to a real allow-list, on production. Adds ICommunityErasureService so a member's data is erased across every installed package in the suite from one call. See CHANGELOG.md.",
  "title": "Community Core for Umbraco",
  "verbatimVersion": "1.3.5",
